sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Job as Lakeflow Job
    participant NB as 00_extract_bronze (notebook task)
    participant API as Ed-Fi API
    participant UC as Unity Catalog
    participant SS as Silver SDP
    participant GS as Gold SDP
    participant E2E as 99_run_e2e_tests

    Job->>NB: start bronze_extract
    NB->>UC: ensure schema edu_demo.edu_bronze
    NB->>UC: SELECT last_change_version FROM _meta_change_versions
    UC-->>NB: { resource → last_cv }
    NB->>API: POST /oauth/token
    API-->>NB: access_token (1800s)
    loop For each Ed-Fi resource in resources.yml
        NB->>API: GET /data/v3/{resource}?minChangeVersion=cv&offset=0&limit=500
        API-->>NB: page of records
        NB->>NB: serialize to (tenant, year, ts, cv, guid, payload)
        NB->>UC: APPEND to {resource}_raw
    end
    NB->>UC: MERGE _meta_change_versions
    NB-->>Job: rows_landed_total

    Job->>SS: start silver_pipeline (SDP)
    SS->>UC: read bronze.{resource}_raw (~73)
    SS->>UC: write silver.{resource}_base / silver.{resource} (~73×2)
    SS-->>Job: green

    Job->>GS: start gold_pipeline (SDP)
    GS->>UC: read silver.* (joins)
    GS->>UC: write gold.dim_* / fct_* / msr_* / brg_* (× 58)
    GS-->>Job: green

    Job->>E2E: start e2e_tests notebook
    E2E->>UC: count, PK uniqueness, FK resolution, invariants
    alt all green
        E2E-->>Job: success
    else any failure
        E2E-->>Job: AssertionError (fails the job)
    end
